## Production Dependencies

Production runtime dependencies bundled into or shipped with `@rpgtoolkit/*` packages will have their copyright notices and license texts recorded below.

Currently, `@rpgtoolkit/core`, `@rpgtoolkit/runner-headless`, and `@rpgtoolkit/runner-harness` have zero production runtime npm dependencies.

